    <briefdescription>
<para>One AdaLoRA adapter layer exported to TT-format. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Each layer (identified by <computeroutput>layer_name</computeroutput>) contributes a rank-2 TT-train (two cores G₀ and G₁) computed from the layer&apos;s B/A weight matrices and current importance scores (singular values approximated from norms).</para>
<para>The <computeroutput>active_rank</computeroutput> field mirrors <ref refid="structthemis_1_1training_1_1_ada_lo_r_a_layer_stats_1ab2f4cc5a77795068cb8d835f5d58bd96" kindref="member">AdaLoRALayerStats::active_rank</ref> and controls how many TT-core columns are non-zero. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
